/// One invoice line: a stock item sold to a customer, delivered to a city, credited to a salesperson, on an invoice date. Revenue = TotalExcludingTax (before tax) or TotalIncludingTax (after tax); Profit is margin per line. BillToCustomerKey is the account invoiced, which can differ from the buying customer. Lines with the same WWIInvoiceID belong to one invoice.
